   <dc:description>
    <rdf:Alt>
     <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">Balanced vivid: median ~102, neutral shadows (44,43,40), soft highlights (214,203,198), sky (100,124,151) saturation 0.34, vivid foliage (saturation 0.52), overall saturation 0.34. Best for: All-round landscape look - daytime mountains, lakes with reflections, autumn colour, lavender/flower fields, destination pre-wedding frames. Safe starting point for most outdoor scenes.</rdf:li>
    </rdf:Alt>
   </dc:description>
